  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0\n\t\t- Added multi-targeting support: netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net6.0, net8.0, net9.0\n\t\t- Removed unconditional dependency on Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.Features; now conditionally included only for net6.0 and above via compile-time directives (#if NET6_0_OR_GREATER)\n\t\t- Fixed critical bug in WithColumn: inverted null-check condition caused all custom column configurations to throw ArgumentException\n\t\t- Fixed UnaryExpression handling in WithColumn: value types (int, decimal, DateTime) were silently returning null due to implicit boxing; now correctly unwrapped from Convert expression\n\t\t- Fixed NullReferenceException in ExcelImporterService constructor when configure parameter was not provided (null-safe invoke with ?.Invoke)\n\t\t- Fixed incorrect date format default in ImporterSettings: \"yyyy/mm/dd\" (minutes) corrected to \"yyyy/MM/dd\" (months)\n\t\t- Fixed missing stream Position reset in IFormFile extension (CopyTo was leaving stream at end)\n\t\t- Added LangVersion latest to csproj to allow modern C# syntax across all target frameworks",
